{
  "name": "WF1 - Crawl My Drive lessons",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "availableInMCP": false
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "wf1-sticky",
      "name": "Import notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, -320],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF1 — crawl My Drive, call WF2\n\nImport **after WF2**. Leave **inactive** until a test run is green.\n\n1. Credential = **EF Google Drive** (`info@evergladesliteracy.org`).\n2. Open **Call WF2** → Workflow **From list** → **WF2 - Process one Drive lesson file** (the imported JSON still has a placeholder ID).\n3. First test: keep **Limit = 25**. After `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM lessons;` looks right, enable **Return All** on List My Drive files.\n\nCatalog: My Drive (`/u/2/my-drive`). Search uses the user corpus (all nested files), then keeps PDFs and Docs only.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wf1-trigger",
      "name": "When clicking Test workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "wf1-search",
      "name": "List My Drive files",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [260, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "fileFolder",
        "operation": "search",
        "searchMethod": "query",
        "queryString": "trashed = false",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 25,
        "filter": {
          "whatToSearch": "files"
        },
        "options": {
          "fields": [
            "id",
            "name",
            "mimeType",
            "webViewLink",
            "*"
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "EF Google Drive"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wf1-filter",
      "name": "Keep PDFs and Docs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [520, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nreturn items.filter(({ json }) => {\n  const mime = String(json.mimeType || '').toLowerCase();\n  const name = String(json.name || '').toLowerCase();\n  return (\n    mime.includes('pdf') ||\n    mime.includes('document') ||\n    mime.includes('msword') ||\n    mime.includes('wordprocessingml') ||\n    name.endsWith('.pdf') ||\n    name.endsWith('.doc') ||\n    name.endsWith('.docx')\n  );\n});"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wf1-execute",
      "name": "Call WF2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [780, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_WF2_ID"
        },
        "mode": "each",
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When clicking Test workflow": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "List My Drive files", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "List My Drive files": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Keep PDFs and Docs", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Keep PDFs and Docs": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Call WF2", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  }
}
